BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-yes@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270120
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder yes: you
DESCRIPTION:Brand says yes: send the campaign agreement (legal pack file 1
 0\, Part 1 from the campaign row)\, the invoice (tools/make_invoice.py) an
 d the certificate request (file 11)\, and ask for the allergen sheet\, log
 o\, two card sentences\, discount code or landing page\, the unused-produc
 t election and the newsletter choice. Latest date that still leaves five b
 usiness days to pay before T-10.\nLog: campaigns row (tier\, offices\, ter
 ms)\; invoices row
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-approvals_ask@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270120
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder approvals ask: you
DESCRIPTION:Ask each office on the route about this brand (template 01). A
 n office's first three drops need its explicit yes\; after that\, notice a
 t least five business days ahead and it comes unless they say no.\nLog: ap
 provals rows: asked_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-building_coi@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270120
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder building coi: you
DESCRIPTION:Offices whose building wants our certificate (coi_required yes
  or unsure): request it from our carrier at least 10 business days before 
 that office's first drop (legal pack file 12)\, only once general liabilit
 y is bound.\nLog: offices: building_coi_status\, building_coi_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-paid@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270127
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder paid: brand
DESCRIPTION:Payment lands in the business account: log paid_date and paid_
 amount on invoices. Founding: due within five business days of the invoice
  and before shipping\; standard: the first 50% on signing. Five business d
 ays late: you decide whether to cancel and refund (file 10\, section 3).\n
 Log: invoices: paid_date\, paid_amount_usd\, method\, bank_reference
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-coi_check@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270127
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder coi check: you
DESCRIPTION:Brand's certificate in: the five-minute check in legal pack fi
 le 11. Tick coi_check_ok on brands. If the policy ends before 12 months af
 ter the window\, diary the renewal certificate.\nLog: campaigns: coi_recei
 ved_date\; brands: coi_check_ok\, coi_policy_end_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-release@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270127
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder release: you
DESCRIPTION:When campaigns shows ship_release RELEASED (payment\, agreemen
 t\, certificate\, every office approved)\, send the ship-date email (templ
 ate 02) the same day. Never confirm a ship date on HOLD.\nLog: campaigns: 
 ship_release
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-ship@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270127
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder ship: brand
DESCRIPTION:Hard ship-by and cancel-by date (T-10). Approvals due. If T-10
  to T-5 crosses 18 to 31 December\, brands were asked to ship earlier (shi
 p_by_requested).\nLog: approvals: reply\, reply_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-receive@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270202
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270203
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder receive: you
DESCRIPTION:Receive and count the day cases arrive (by T-5 at the latest):
  count against the packing list\, best-by at least 60 days after T\, lot n
 umbers\, damage\; photograph the cases. Reject what fails and tell the bra
 nd the same day. Check the allergen line on the card text word for word ag
 ainst a package in your hand. Short shipment: reduce units per office even
 ly (units_override) and tell the brand.\nLog: inventory: received (lot\, b
 est_by)\, rejected\; issues
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-card_proof@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270202
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270203
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder card proof: you
DESCRIPTION:Send the brand the card text before printing (brand agreement 
 section 1): two sentences\, allergen line\, buy line.\nLog: campaigns: car
 d_proof_sent_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-forms@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270203
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270204
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder forms: you
DESCRIPTION:Make each campaign's survey form (forms/survey-form.md) and\, 
 if the brand chose it\, its newsletter sign-up form. Paste the prefill tem
 plate into campaigns. Then make the links and QR codes and import them int
 o the link tool.\nLog: campaigns: survey_form_url\, survey_prefill_templat
 e\, newsletter_form_url
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-kit_print@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270204
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270205
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder kit print: you
DESCRIPTION:Not arrived (founder\, courier) = slip exactly one week (tools
 /opscal.py slip) and tell every office and the brand today (template 12). 
 Otherwise print cards and labels (make_kit.py\; qr-check.txt must say all 
 OK)\, test-scan every card\, and send each office its window and Slack pos
 t (template 03).\nLog: stops: slack_post_sent_date\; costs: kit
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-confirm@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270208
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270209
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder confirm: you
DESCRIPTION:Text each pantry owner to confirm (template 04). Pack one labe
 led case per office per brand against the kit checklist\; bag and label th
 e reserve. Print the route sheet. Charge the phone\, load the hand truck. 
 Read every link's total after your test scans and log it as the baseline.\
 nLog: stops: confirm_text_sent_date\; scans: baseline
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-drop@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270209
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270210
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder drop: you or courier
DESCRIPTION:Drop day\, 8 to 11 am: route in order\; 'on my way' 20 minutes
  out (template 05)\; the per-stop procedure on the route sheet. Courier: y
 ou meet the courier at every first-drop office. Log everything the same da
 y.\nLog: stops: arrival\, departure\, handed_to_role\, outcome\; inventory
 : delivered\; photos\; counts: placed\; issues\; hours: drop_day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-placement_confirm@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270210
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270211
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder placement confirm: you
DESCRIPTION:Placement confirmation to each brand (template 06): the office
 s placed by today\, each with its photo. Office not placed by today: credi
 t note row and refund or take it off the balance ($120 founding\, $150 sta
 ndard). Standard: issue the balance invoice today.\nLog: invoices: credit_
 note\, standard_balance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-day3@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270212
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder day3: you and office
DESCRIPTION:Day 3: ask each office for a count (template 07)\; top up from
  reserve where empty\; nudge any office under five responses. Read the lin
 ks (mid).\nLog: counts: remaining_day3\; inventory: topped_up\; scans: mid
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-close@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270216
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270217
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder close: you and office
DESCRIPTION:Day 5: last photo and count (template 08)\; collect leftovers 
 (brand chose return) or leave them (release). At the end of the day turn o
 ff 'Accepting responses' on every campaign survey form and read every link
  total (close).\nLog: counts: remaining_day5\; photos: later\; inventory: 
 collected or released_to_office\; scans: close
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-pass_on@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270217
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270218
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder pass on: you
DESCRIPTION:Newsletter (only where chosen): send the ticked addresses once
  (template 09)\, delete the unticked responses today\, log the count only.
  Reconcile stock: reserve and leftovers on hand. Ask for the return label 
 (brand chose return).\nLog: campaigns: newsletter_passed_date\, newsletter
 _passed_count\, newsletter_unticked_deleted_date
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
