DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270218
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270219
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder report draft: you
DESCRIPTION:Pick three comments word for word (replace names with [name re
 moved])\, write three 'learned' lines and the recommendation on the campai
 gn row.\nLog: campaigns: comment_1..3\, learned\, recommendation
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-report@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270219
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270220
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder report: you
DESCRIPTION:Report (make_report.py) to each brand with template 10\; stand
 ard: after the balance is paid. Office summaries to each office. Log repor
 t_delivered_date.\nLog: campaigns: report_delivered_date
