UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-office_debrief@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270223
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270224
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder office debrief: you and office
DESCRIPTION:Ten-minute debrief with each office (templates/debrief-office.
 md). Log the date and the one-question answer.\nLog: stops: office_debrief
 _date\, office_would_do_again
