END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-debrief@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270224
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270225
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder debrief: you and brand
DESCRIPTION:Brand debrief\, 20 minutes (templates/debrief-brand.md)\; send
  the renewal proposal the same day. Export actuals for the financial model
  (export_actuals.py) and set Actuals in = Y there once money\, costs and h
 ours are final.\nLog: campaigns: debrief_date\, brand_would_buy_again\, re
 newed\; hours: reporting_debriefs
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:SAMPLE-model-founder-return_deadline@campaign-ops
DTSTAMP:20261024T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270302
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270303
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-model-founder return deadline: you
DESCRIPTION:Ten business days after the window: no prepaid return label = 
 unused reserve to roster offices\, collected leftovers back to their own o
 ffice or disposed (brand agreement section 9). Stock on hand must be zero.
 \nLog: inventory: returned_to_brand / given_to_roster_office / released_to
 _office / disposed
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
